---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import AffiliateLink from "../../components/AffiliateLink.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Forza Horizon 5 — Xbox Buying Guide"
  description="Forza Horizon 5 buying guide: open-world racing, editions, and where to buy the digital Xbox version cheapest."
>
  <article class="post">
    <h1>Forza Horizon 5 — Xbox Buying Guide</h1>
    <p class="meta">Xbox · Updated 2026-08-05</p>

    <p>
      <strong>Forza Horizon 5</strong> is Playground Games' open-world racing festival
      set in a stylized Mexico — widely regarded as the best arcade racer on Xbox, with
      hundreds of cars and a seamless shared world.
    </p>

    <h2>Standard vs Premium Edition</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Standard</strong> — the full game with all core content</li>
      <li><strong>Premium / Deluxe</strong> — add car packs and early access; buy only if you want the extras immediately</li>
      <li><strong>Xbox Game Pass</strong> — was day-one on Game Pass; if you subscribe, you may not need to buy at all</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Where to buy cheapest</h2>
    <p>
      Xbox digital codes on Green Man Gaming routinely beat the Microsoft Store, and
      Forza sees steady key-store cuts. If you're not on Game Pass, a GMG code is usually
      the cheapest permanent copy.
    </p>

    <ul class="buy-list">
      <li>
        <AffiliateLink
          network="gmg"
          href="https://www.greenmangaming.com/search/?q=forza+horizon+5+xbox"
          cta="Check Green Man Gaming"
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <AffiliateLink
          network="amazon"
          href="https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Forza+Horizon+5+Xbox"
          cta="Check on Amazon"
        />
      </li>
    </ul>

    <p class="note">
      Prices change frequently — always verify on the store before purchasing.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .post { padding: 1.5rem 0; max-width: 720px; }
  .post h1 { font-size: 1.8rem; }
  .meta { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.85rem; }
  .buy-list { list-style: none; padding: 0; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.75rem; }
  .note { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.85rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; }
</style>
